# Household tenancy

There is no database RLS. Every application-layer D1 read/write must filter with `scopeToHousehold()` from `@amigo/db`. Schema declarations, migrations, and seed SQL/TS do not use `scopeToHousehold()`.

```ts
// BAD
eq(transactions.id, id)

// GOOD
and(
  eq(transactions.id, id),
  scopeToHousehold(transactions.householdId, session.householdId),
  isNull(transactions.deletedAt)
)
```

- Do not trust client-supplied `householdId`.
- Use `session.householdId` from resolved Clerk session.
- Soft-delete tables: also `isNull(….deletedAt)` unless the query is explicitly restoring.
